WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Two brands appeared
in every answer.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.320
Only one ranked first
in all four comparisons.

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:10.234
In Recoscope’s October 29
standing desk snapshot,

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:14.681
UPLIFT and FlexiSpot each
appeared in all 12 usable answers,

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.383
across 4 assistants
and 3 prompt types.

00:00:17.928 --> 00:00:20.013
That’s a tie
in mention frequency.

00:00:20.752 --> 00:00:22.937
But in the
comparative prompt,

00:00:23.035 --> 00:00:26.426
ChatGPT, Claude,
Gemini and Perplexity

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.643
all ranked UPLIFT first.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:33.565
FlexiSpot placed second in 3 answers,
and third in Claude’s.

00:00:33.565 --> 00:00:36.261
For brand teams,
track both:

00:00:36.261 --> 00:00:38.087
how often you appear,

00:00:38.087 --> 00:00:39.957
and where you rank
in a comparison.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.670
These findings describe
this captured snapshot.

00:00:43.819 --> 00:00:47.053
They don’t establish product quality,
market share

00:00:47.053 --> 00:00:49.214
or independently
tested performance.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.500
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
